# Optional: ENTSO-E Transparency Platform Web API token.
# The pipeline works WITHOUT this (it uses the no-key porssisahko.net feed).
# Provide it to add ENTSO-E as an authoritative official source.
#
# To obtain one: register at https://transparency.entsoe.eu, then email
# transparency@entsoe.eu (from the registered address) with subject
# "Restful API access". The token appears under My Account Settings.
#
# In GitHub, store it as a repository secret named ENTSO_E_TOKEN (not here).
ENTSO_E_TOKEN=
